  "description": "Sweet watercolor ice cream clipart bundle featuring elegant gelato bowls, soft serve cones, colorful sundaes, creamy frozen desserts, and modern summer café treats in bright pastel tones 🍨☀️\nThis collection combines soft painterly watercolor textures, playful dessert styling, smooth creamy surfaces, and luxurious summer aesthetics in a clean illustration style. \n✨ Perfect for:\n• Print on demand products\n• Summer stickers\n• Party invitations\n• Scrapbooking\n• Packaging & branding\n• Digital planners\n• Sublimation products\n💖 What’s included:\n– 20 high-quality illustrations\n– Transparent background\n– High resolution – 300 DPI (perfect for print & digital use)\n– 20 PNG files (transparent background)\n– 20 SVG files\n🍦 Included illustrations: vanilla soft serve cone, strawberry sundae, pistachio gelato, chocolate brownie ice cream bowl, triple berry dessert dish, matcha soft serve cone, banana split dessert, cookies-and-cream ice cream tub, peach gelato bowl, affogato dessert cup, cotton candy ice cream bowl, lemon sorbet coupe, mint chocolate chip waffle bowl, caramel popcorn sundae, raspberry cheesecake ice cream jar, coconut vanilla dessert shell, blueberry lavender gelato, neapolitan dessert plate, tiramisu ice cream cup, mango passionfruit gelato.\nThis bundle is perfect for colorful summer merchandise, playful dessert branding, aesthetic stationery, café-inspired designs, stickers, greeting cards, and cheerful print projects. The illustrations feature smooth watercolor shading, soft pastel colors, clean silhouettes, and minimal micro-details that make them especially suitable for vector tracing and commercial design work.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Sweet watercolor ice cream clipart bundle featuring elegant gelato bowls, soft serve cones, colorful sundaes, creamy frozen desserts, and modern summer café treats in bright pastel tones 🍨☀️<br>\nThis collection combines soft painterly watercolor textures, playful dessert styling, smooth creamy surfaces, and luxurious summer aesthetics in a clean illustration style. </p>\n<p>✨ Perfect for:<br>\n• Print on demand products<br>\n• Summer stickers<br>\n• Party invitations<br>\n• Scrapbooking<br>\n• Packaging &amp; branding<br>\n• Digital planners<br>\n• Sublimation products</p>\n<p>💖 What’s included:<br>\n– 20 high-quality illustrations<br>\n– Transparent background<br>\n– High resolution – 300 DPI (perfect for print &amp; digital use)<br>\n– 20 PNG files (transparent background)<br>\n– 20 SVG files</p>\n<p>🍦 Included illustrations: vanilla soft serve cone, strawberry sundae, pistachio gelato, chocolate brownie ice cream bowl, triple berry dessert dish, matcha soft serve cone, banana split dessert, cookies-and-cream ice cream tub, peach gelato bowl, affogato dessert cup, cotton candy ice cream bowl, lemon sorbet coupe, mint chocolate chip waffle bowl, caramel popcorn sundae, raspberry cheesecake ice cream jar, coconut vanilla dessert shell, blueberry lavender gelato, neapolitan dessert plate, tiramisu ice cream cup, mango passionfruit gelato.</p>\n<p>This bundle is perfect for colorful summer merchandise, playful dessert branding, aesthetic stationery, café-inspired designs, stickers, greeting cards, and cheerful print projects. The illustrations feature smooth watercolor shading, soft pastel colors, clean silhouettes, and minimal micro-details that make them especially suitable for vector tracing and commercial design work.</p>",
